# KEYBREAK environment variables
#
# DATABASE_URL — Neon PostgreSQL connection string (SERVER ONLY).
#   1. Create a project at https://console.neon.tech
#   2. Dashboard -> Connect -> copy the "Pooled connection" string
#   3. Paste it below into a local .env file (never commit .env)
#   4. Run db/schema.sql once in the Neon SQL Editor
#
# Never expose this as NEXT_PUBLIC_DATABASE_URL — it must stay server-side.
DATABASE_URL=
